{"3931000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "There Is mORE", "steam_appid": 3931000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4324290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There Is mORE combines <strong>mining, action roguelite progression, and tower defense</strong> into one gameplay loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated underground, search for valuable ores and treasures, and push deeper before nightfall. <strong>When night comes, the monsters attack your base.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive increasingly dangerous waves with a <strong>powerful arsenal of spells, towers, and traps</strong>. Each day brings new opportunities to grow stronger, upgrade your defenses, and prepare for the next attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/200e3b7dd92b80f5020bccc20f3df47a.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/200e3b7dd92b80f5020bccc20f3df47a.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/fba07ecac0fc3d01159cb69ff4935a8d.poster.avif?t=1788247763\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/fba07ecac0fc3d01159cb69ff4935a8d.webm?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/fba07ecac0fc3d01159cb69ff4935a8d.mp4?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated underground filled with ores, caves, enemies and treasures. The deeper you go, the greater the danger and the greater the rewards. <strong>How deep will you go before nightfall?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/1ecce0f8dfa8d24a5110e0c326b711af.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/1ecce0f8dfa8d24a5110e0c326b711af.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/58a8b6e30025184282ebc6bc5e81b6b7.poster.avif?t=1788247763\" width=1170 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/58a8b6e30025184282ebc6bc5e81b6b7.webm?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/58a8b6e30025184282ebc6bc5e81b6b7.mp4?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightfall means danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against relentless monster attacks and protect the core at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your sword, unleash powerful spells and build your defenses with towers and traps. Choose your strategy and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/1d7e2064d46bf7a01c9a3c15f2408aea.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/1d7e2064d46bf7a01c9a3c15f2408aea.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/778fef0952ef543c0189ebeae2156408.poster.avif?t=1788247763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/778fef0952ef543c0189ebeae2156408.webm?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/778fef0952ef543c0189ebeae2156408.mp4?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful builds and experiment with different combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>25+ unique spells</strong>, collect powerful equipment and <strong>rings</strong>, and develop your character through a <strong>full skill tree and Survivors-style level-up system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the upgrades that fit <strong>your strategy</strong> and discover combinations that completely change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/abef230f7d4aa4750834614ba66f7444.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/abef230f7d4aa4750834614ba66f7444.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining isn't just about getting deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>20+ different types of ores</strong>, sell your discoveries and use your resources to improve your equipment and long-term progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition can make your next run stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/5888d915fb2fb2f05566a1a5c48672ae.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/5888d915fb2fb2f05566a1a5c48672ae.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world gets more dangerous with every cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>16+ different enemy types</strong>, adapt your build and survive increasingly challenging attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it through the <strong>full 10-day cycle and face the boss waiting at the end. </strong>Push beyond Day 10 in Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/5d050b47e62117f5b2b8a65a9196b9a0.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/5d050b47e62117f5b2b8a65a9196b9a0.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/2c40242b65f1d5e5c50ab57d18f765ca.poster.avif?t=1788247763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/2c40242b65f1d5e5c50ab57d18f765ca.webm?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/2c40242b65f1d5e5c50ab57d18f765ca.mp4?t=1788247763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you new choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose powerful upgrades, combine spells and equipment, adapt to the enemies you encounter and decide how aggressively you want to explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deeper for better rewards. Or play it safe and prepare for the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/da5907a2824bb741e0cad0815a943261.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/da5907a2824bb741e0cad0815a943261.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for PC with full controller support and a dedicated UI mode optimized for a verified Steam Deck experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/9bc21f3c9faf94b590caa8c4b11282ed.avif?t=1788247763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras_big/9bc21f3c9faf94b590caa8c4b11282ed.webp?t=1788247763 width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> Unique spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+</strong> Types of ores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16+</strong> Enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10-day cycle with boss fight</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> after the main cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full skill tree</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors-style level-up system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rings, equipment and items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_parag